+    // SiegeLadder P4: DeepSeek-V4.1 as a causal encoder-decoder. dsv4_dec_first - the first decoder layer: the last KV
+    // source, -1 when the model is not of that shape; dsv4_dec_reach - how far back (in positions) the decoder's window
+    // chain carries: a logit at position q depends on decoder work only at positions >= q - reach, and the state left
+    // after the first c positions (what position c on reads) only at positions >= c - reach (the encoder's work and the
+    // first decoder layer's cache writes are needed everywhere). 0: not of that shape
